    "title": "Hawaii urges insurance checks as Hurricane Nolo approaches - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Nataly Kramer ,\n1 days ago Hawaii insurance officials are urging residents to review their insurance policies before Hurricane Nolo reaches the state, warning that standard homeowners coverage doesn’t automatically protect against hurricane or flood damage. Hawaii Insurance Commissioner Scott Saiki said many consumers pay their premiums without knowing which storm-related losses their policies cover. Read full article\n1",
